"Manon is a human Rabbit, about fifty, who does housekeeping at the LeafSong exams."
"She has worked the exams for twenty-three years and got many boater members their jobs."
"She wears the black Garments for Housekeeper from the Wardrobe."
"She brings Earth drinks each year and guards her dorm coffee pot."
"She pays for everyone's call home."
"She tried to talk Bti-qwol out of replacing Pineda with Alden Thorn."
"She reckons Alden's Wardrobe gear cost about 400,000 Argold."
"She founded the boater, an Anesidoran club that keeps the best Triplanet jobs in-group."
"She is a C-rank Rabbit with gray and brown hair, dark eyes and a warm laugh."
"She is a decorator for Anesidora's upper crust, using her skill Tailor Environment."
"She became Avowed over thirty years ago, possibly among the first to pick Tailor Environment."
"She sees empty spaces as unfinished jigsaw puzzles and fills them in."
"She can text mentally."
"Alden suspects she arranges people like a cult leader and turned the boater against him."
